                     Rows Removed by Filter: 2
                     Heap Blocks: exact=4
                     ->  Bitmap Index Scan on spoint10k_star_idx  (rows=2 width=0) (actual rows=8 loops=1)
                           Index Cond: (star <@ '<(1 , 1) , 0.05>'::scircle)
         ->  Materialize  (rows=8 width=16) (actual rows=15 loops=12)
               ->  Bitmap Heap Scan on spoint10k a  (rows=8 width=16) (actual rows=15 loops=1)
                     Filter: spoint_dwithin(star, '(1 , 1)'::spoint, '0.1'::double precision)
                     Rows Removed by Filter: 4
                     Heap Blocks: exact=5
                     ->  Bitmap Index Scan on spoint10k_star_idx  (rows=8 width=0) (actual rows=19 loops=1)
                           Index Cond: (star <@ '<(1 , 1) , 0.1>'::scircle)
 Optimizer: Postgres-based planner
(19 rows)

